OL,3,GNEWSAPupils at fire-damaged school are
OL,4,Alearning at home
OL,5,
OL,6,FPupils at a fire-damaged primary school
OL,7,Fare working remotely as the new term
OL,8,Fbegins.
OL,10,FChildren at the Thomas Bullock Primary
OL,11,FAcademy in Shipdam, near Dereham will
OL,12,Fbe learning from home for seven days
OL,13,Fbefore moving into a temporary site
OL,14,Fnear the village.
OL,16,FThe fire took hold on 13 August,
OL,17,Fdamaging five areas of the school
OL,18,Fincluding classrooms.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
