OL,3,GNEWSAPupils at fire-damaged school are
OL,4,Alearning at home
OL,5,
OL,6,FOliver Burwood, chief executive of the
OL,7,FDiocese of Norwich Education and
OL,8,FAcademies Trust, said: "The parental
OL,9,Fcommunity and whole community of
OL,10,FShipdham have been amazing. It has been
OL,11,Fan incredible response from them."
